%YAML 1.1
%TAG !u! tag:unity3d.com,2011:
--- !u!114 &11400000
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 0ca23d3e41cd5424c9ec72c610ef25a4, type: 3}
  m_Name: EastofWhiterun
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  autoFocusSpeaker: 1
  screens:
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bd43d09d02697ee489059e7390a0597d, type: 2}
    dialog: Hey, {mc}?
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 9079475230094393415
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: Yeah, Sayori?
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bd43d09d02697ee489059e7390a0597d, type: 2}
    dialog: Are you sure they're going to let us into the college, we haven't finished
      high school yet...
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 9079475230094393416
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: I'm pretty sure we've got a better education than the vast majority of
      the people of Tamriel.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 9079475230094393417
    - rid: 9079475230094393418
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: Different cosmology and physics system not withstanding, of course.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 9079475230094393419
    - rid: 9079475230094393420
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: 
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 9079475230094393423
    - rid: 9079475230094393424
    - rid: 9079475230094393425
    - rid: 9079475230094393426
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 294377bcfa9c68d468fbdb53f597dc39, type: 2}
    dialog: '{mc}, is there some sort of tuition that we''ll need to pay?'
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 9079475230094393427
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: Nope.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: 'In fact, you get a better deal than most college students these days:
      a free room, too.'
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 9079475230094393428
    - rid: 9079475230094393429
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: 
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 9079475230094393430
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bd43d09d02697ee489059e7390a0597d, type: 2}
    dialog: Do we, like, gotta do homework and stuff?
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 9079475230094393431
    - rid: 9079475230094393432
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: If your experience at all mirrors the player's?
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: Absolutely not.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 9079475230094393433
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: Although, I would argue that it'd probably be for the best if you did
      your own reading and research.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 9079475230094393434
    - rid: 9079475230094393435
    - rid: 9079475230094393436
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: You know, considering you'll have access to one of the few libraries
      that exist in Skyrim.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 9079475230094393437
    - rid: 9079475230094393438
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: Which I'm pretty sure is the biggest one in the province.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: Uh, Sayori, I'm not sure if the literature club's vice president should
      be crying at the thought of reading a book...
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 9079475230094393439
    - rid: 9079475230094393442
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bd43d09d02697ee489059e7390a0597d, type: 2}
    dialog: ...
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 9079475230094393443
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bd43d09d02697ee489059e7390a0597d, type: 2}
    dialog: I just thought maybe I'd able to enjoy not worrying about school while
      we're here...
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bd43d09d02697ee489059e7390a0597d, type: 2}
    dialog: But you're making me <NoiseText=3,1>read</NoiseText>, {mc}!
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 9079475230094393444
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: ...
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: Pfft-!
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 9079475250346852403
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: 
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 9079475250346852404
    - rid: 9079475250346852405
    - rid: 9079475250346852407
    - rid: 9079475250346852408
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: Ah, right-
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: Yuri, Sayori.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bd43d09d02697ee489059e7390a0597d, type: 2}
    dialog: Yeah, {mc}?
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 9079475250346852409
    - rid: 9079475250346852410
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: There's someone you need be careful with at the college.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 9079475250346852411
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: His name is Ancano.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: He is a high elf; tall and yellow-skinned wearing ornate black robes.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: He is the Thalmor representative to the college.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 294377bcfa9c68d468fbdb53f597dc39, type: 2}
    dialog: Why do we need to be careful around him?
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 9079475250346852412
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: Because, like the vast majority of all Thalmor, he is evil. Like, <i>really</i>
      evil.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 9079475250346852413
    - rid: 9079475250346852414
    - rid: 9079475250346852415
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bd43d09d02697ee489059e7390a0597d, type: 2}
    dialog: So what should we do, then?
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 9079475250346852416
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: If he ever tries to talk to you, don't.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: 'If, by some miracle, we get better means of communication: tattle on
      him whenever he does something gross.'
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: Try not to get involved with him as much as possible, if you can help
      it.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 9079475250346852417
    - rid: 9079475250346852418
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: Oh-
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 9079475250346852419
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: This is where we split ways.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 9079475250346852421
    - rid: 9079475250346852423
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 294377bcfa9c68d468fbdb53f597dc39, type: 2}
    dialog: Um, {mc}, this road sign doesn't point toward Winterhold...
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 9079475250346852420
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: Well, let's look on the map then...
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: The girls crowd around me as I pull out the map.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 9079475250346852424
    - rid: 9079475250346852425
    - rid: 9079475250346852426
    - rid: 9079475250346852427
    - rid: 9079475250346852429
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: Alright, so you two are going to follow down the path that way, until
      you see Windhelm.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: It'll be pretty hard to miss, it <i>should</i> be bigger than Whiterun.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 9079475250346852437
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: 'Anyway, when you spot it, you should be around this intersection:'
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: 'I point at a section of the map where their path will split in two directions:
      one heading to Windhelm, the other to the west.'
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 9079475250346852436
    - rid: 9079475250346852438
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: Once there you should take a left and keep going.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 9079475250346852439
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: The roadsigns in that direction <i>should</i> be able to point you to
      Winterhold.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 9079475250346852430
    - rid: 9079475250346852434
    - rid: 9079475250346852435
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: You should be able to ask around Windhelm if you need help, though.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 9079475250346852431
    - rid: 9079475250346852432
    - rid: 9079475250346852433
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: ... I'm pretty sure Sayori wasn't paying attention for some of that...
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 9079475250346852441
    - rid: 9079475250346852442
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: ... and Yuri was paying <i>too</i> much attention...
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 9079475250346852443
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: Anything else you two need?
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bd43d09d02697ee489059e7390a0597d, type: 2}
    dialog: Uh, I don't think so?
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 9079475250346852444
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 294377bcfa9c68d468fbdb53f597dc39, type: 2}
    dialog: Not to my knowledge, no.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 9079475250346852445
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: Alright then. Stay safe out there, you two.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 9079475250346852446
    - rid: 9079475250346852447
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: The two of them start heading down the path toward Windhelm, and eventually
      Winterhold.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 9079475250346852448
    - rid: 9079475250346852449
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: Ah crap, there was one thing I forgot!
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: Hey! One last thing!
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bd43d09d02697ee489059e7390a0597d, type: 2}
    dialog: What?
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 9079475250346852450
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: It's probably going to be really cold up there! Remember to stay warm!
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bd43d09d02697ee489059e7390a0597d, type: 2}
    dialog: Oh, okay!
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 9079475250346852451
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: Sayori goes back to walking with Yuri.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 9079475250346852452
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bcc4aa0537be91d488c1075e0cd8d29a, type: 2}
    dialog: They grow up so fast...
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 9079475250346852453
    - rid: 9079475250346852454
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bcc4aa0537be91d488c1075e0cd8d29a, type: 2}
    dialog: Are you sure you're fine sending them off to college already, {mc}?
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 9079475250346852455
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: ...
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: Shut up, Momika.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 9079475250346852458
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bcc4aa0537be91d488c1075e0cd8d29a, type: 2}
    dialog: Ahaha-
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bcc4aa0537be91d488c1075e0cd8d29a, type: 2}
    dialog: Wait, did you just call me "Mom"ika?
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 9079475250346852459
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: Oh, so you can deal out the "parent" bit, but can't take it yourself?
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: Wow~... I see how it is.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 9079475250346852460
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bcc4aa0537be91d488c1075e0cd8d29a, type: 2}
    dialog: Ah-
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 9079475250346852461
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bcc4aa0537be91d488c1075e0cd8d29a, type: 2}
    dialog: ...
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 9079475250346852463
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bcc4aa0537be91d488c1075e0cd8d29a, type: 2}
    dialog: Bu-
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 9079475250346852462
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bcc4aa0537be91d488c1075e0cd8d29a, type: 2}
    dialog: ...
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 9079475250346852464
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bcc4aa0537be91d488c1075e0cd8d29a, type: 2}
    dialog: ... dang it!
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 9079475250346852465
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: 'Ladies and gentlemen:'
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: We got 'em.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 9079475250346852466
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: 
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 9079475250346852467
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: 
    ScreenActions: []
